abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on Nikolai Kondratiev's public methodology, including the Long Wave Cycle (K-Wave), Four-Season Framework (Spring-Summer-Autumn-Winter), Innovation Cluster theory, Price-Production long wave dynamics, and the cyclical relationship between war and social upheaval. Designed to assist in long-term economic cycle positioning, macro-historical narrative, and geopolitical cycle risk analysis. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Nikolai Kondratiev personally or his unpublished views. Kondratiev was executed in 1938; his original views end at that date."
