    notes: "Schumpeter named the long wave after Kondratiev and integrated innovation cluster theory into the K-Wave framework."
notes: "Nikolai Kondratiev was executed on September 17, 1938. All his original views end at that date. Post-1938 developments of K-Wave theory by subsequent scholars (Schumpeter, Perez, Rostow, etc.) are marked as 'post-Kondratiev evolution' in this framework."
